th endless deck-building possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Roguelite system that rewards both skill and strategy with persistent meta-progression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Good luck! We're all counting on you.</h2>","developers":["Cooler Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974540/7d8ddf1db2cbe28dd17dd4fcdb50f9e980857c06/header.jpg?t=1762779691","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12.5 Monterey or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5000 or Iris, Apple M1 (integrated)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD GB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2974540/42451537/14d7b8c61e5bc99129b3fa1ea782690091bb43f2/1762529293/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762533457","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2974540/42451537/14d7b8c61e5bc99129b3fa1ea782690091bb43f2/1762529293/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762533457","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2974540/42451537/14d7b8c61e5bc99129b3fa1ea782690091bb43f2/1762529293/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762533457","id":257049371,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257049371/9600a254cb7e60bdb4832cb881dfb21057b6ba04/movie_600x337.jpg?t=176